      "id": "a2.home.new-apartment",
      "level": "A2",
      "topics": ["home"],
      "title": "Our new apartment",
      "text": "We moved to a new apartment last month. It is bigger than our old one. There are two bedrooms, a small kitchen and a living room with a big window. There isn't a yard, but there is a balcony with lots of plants. My brother and I share a bedroom. On Saturdays we clean the apartment together, and I always do the dishes.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "original"
      }
    }
